      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Incorporeal Movement. The avatar can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Magic Items",
        "section": "10.164",
